  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.3.0 Update ApexGantt core to 3.15.0 (from ~3.11). Load the core as a self-contained ES module (no script tag or CDN needed). Port the expanded 3.15 API: dependencies-as-objects with lag/type, baselines, working calendar, assignees, task segments, summary bars, column configuration, sorting/grouping/filtering, critical path, crosshair, undo/redo history, and many appearance options; add all 20 core events and a public method API (task CRUD, dependencies, undo/redo, sort/group/filter, columns, selection, zoom, export). Note: the obsolete ViewMode and EnableToolbar options were removed (use PixelsPerDay and the toolbar options); per-task Color/ClassName/CustomData were replaced by BarBackgroundColor/RowBackgroundColor and inline additional data.\n\n      1.2.0 License Manager\n      1.0.0 Initial release",
